{"id":"00208e314088402a","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-knuth-bendix-completion.md","title":"Knuth-Bendix","display":"Knuth-Bendix","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","display":"Knuth-Bendix","label":"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion","aliases":["56-df-knuth-bendix-completion"],"type":"definition","depends_on":["[[56-df-equational-theory]]","[[56-df-reduction-order]]","[[56-df-critical-pair]]","[[56-df-overlap]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]"],"source_section":"7.4 Table 7.7; 7.4.2","source_pages":"278–280","source_ocr_blocks":[299,300,301],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"display","html":"Knuth-Bendix"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-knuth-bendix-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4176ebfcf797c869\" href=\"?note=4176ebfcf797c869\" title=\"56-df-critical-pair\">56-df-critical-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0ec3908763541719\" href=\"?note=0ec3908763541719\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive\">56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.4 Table 7.7; 7.4.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"278–280"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>299</span><span>300</span><span>301</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,R,E&#39;,R&#39;\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\">\\(E,R,E&#39;,R&#39;\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\)</span> 为候选状态分量，不预先要求候选规则集合法；等式对接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"59b9207cce58252c\" href=\"?note=59b9207cce58252c\" title=\"56-df-equational-theory\">56-df-equational-theory</a>。状态谓词和步骤谓词在全部这些候选分量上定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPBetween}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPBetween}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4176ebfcf797c869\" href=\"?note=4176ebfcf797c869\" title=\"56-df-critical-pair\">56-df-critical-pair</a>，项对同时改名谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variant}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variant}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_P^*\">\\(\\to_P^*\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0ec3908763541719\" href=\"?note=0ec3908763541719\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive\">56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive</a>。以下辅助函数的规则参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq T^2\">\\(C\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,u\\in T\">\\(s,u\\in T\\)</span>；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,R&#39;\">\\(R,R&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}:=\n\\{(E,R)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)^2:\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}:=\n\\{(E,R)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)^2:\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KBState}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E,R)\\iff(E,R)\\in\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KBState}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E,R)\\iff(E,R)\\in\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho)&amp;:=\n\\bigcup_{\\eta\\in P\\cup\\{\\rho\\}}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho,\\eta)\\cup\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\eta,\\rho)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPBasisNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho,C)&amp;\\iff\nC\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho)\\;\n\\exists(u,v)\\in C\\;\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(u,v),(s,t)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(s,u)&amp;\\iff\ns\\to_P^*u\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_P,u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho)&amp;:=\n\\bigcup_{\\eta\\in P\\cup\\{\\rho\\}}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho,\\eta)\\cup\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\eta,\\rho)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPBasisNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho,C)&amp;\\iff\nC\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho)\\;\n\\exists(u,v)\\in C\\;\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(u,v),(s,t)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(s,u)&amp;\\iff\ns\\to_P^*u\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_P,u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KBStep}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E,R,E&#39;,R&#39;)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\exists(A,P),(B,Q)\\in\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}\\;\\bigl[\n(E,R)=(A,P)\\land(E&#39;,R&#39;)=(B,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists(s,t)\\in A\\;\\exists u,v\\in T\\;[\n\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(s,u)\\land\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(t,v)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl((u=v\\land B=A\\setminus\\{(s,t)\\}\\land Q=P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists(l,r)\\in\\{(u,v),(v,u)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\n\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\;[\nl&gt;r\\land Q=P\\cup\\{(l,r)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{CPBasisNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,(l,r),C)\n\\land B=(A\\cup C)\\setminus\\{(s,t)\\}]\\bigr)]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KBStep}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E,R,E&#39;,R&#39;)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\exists(A,P),(B,Q)\\in\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}\\;\\bigl[\n(E,R)=(A,P)\\land(E&#39;,R&#39;)=(B,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists(s,t)\\in A\\;\\exists u,v\\in T\\;[\n\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(s,u)\\land\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(t,v)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\bigl((u=v\\land B=A\\setminus\\{(s,t)\\}\\land Q=P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists(l,r)\\in\\{(u,v),(v,u)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\n\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\;[\nl&gt;r\\land Q=P\\cup\\{(l,r)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{CPBasisNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,(l,r),C)\n\\land B=(A\\cup C)\\setminus\\{(s,t)\\}]\\bigr)]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>候选状态可以不合法；只有从合法状态集合选出的规则集才用于正规形归约和临界对构造，因此定义不在非法规则集上调用部分接口。</p>\n<p>这是 Table 7.7 的简单 Knuth–Bendix 算法的关系化形式：选择未决等式，分别化至当前 R 的正规形；相同则删除，不同则沿 &gt; 定向并加入涉及新规则的全部临界对的有限改名代表。CPBetween 收集所有改名和 MGU，可能无限，故这里显式选择有限基 C；覆盖条件使用本书已定义的项对同时改名谓词，保证未漏掉任何临界对义务。有限规则在改名意义下只有有限多个临界对。由于 R 未必合流，正规形允许选择，故使用转移关系而非假称总确定函数。给定 reduction order 时当前 R 总终止。若不等正规形两向均不可比较，则该次选择失败；若 E=∅，则成功。原书明确还有无限运行，不能承诺任意输入成功。此简单版本不在运行中简化既有规则；§7.5 的更广泛 BC 算法需要另行规定 fairness。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；7.4 Table 7.7; 7.4.2，印刷页 278–280。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-equational-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-critical-pair","status":"resolved","id":"4176ebfcf797c869","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-critical-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-overlap","status":"resolved","id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-overlap]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"0ec3908763541719","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对任意集合 $X$，记 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|<\\aleph_0\\}$。设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)$，见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]。$E,R,E',R'\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$ 为候选状态分量，不预先要求候选规则集合法；等式对接口见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。状态谓词和步骤谓词在全部这些候选分量上定义。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对任意集合 $X$，记 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|<\\aleph_0\\}$。设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)$，见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]。$E,R,E',R'\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$ 为候选状态分量，不预先要求候选规则集合法；等式对接口见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。状态谓词和步骤谓词在全部这些候选分量上定义。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-critical-pair","status":"resolved","id":"4176ebfcf797c869","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPBetween}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]，项对同时改名谓词 $\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 与 $\\to_P^*$ 分别见 [[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]。以下辅助函数的规则参数 $P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))$，$\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$C\\subseteq T^2$，$s,u\\in T$；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 $R,R'$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-overlap","status":"resolved","id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPBetween}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]，项对同时改名谓词 $\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 与 $\\to_P^*$ 分别见 [[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]。以下辅助函数的规则参数 $P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))$，$\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$C\\subseteq T^2$，$s,u\\in T$；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 $R,R'$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPBetween}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]，项对同时改名谓词 $\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 与 $\\to_P^*$ 分别见 [[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]。以下辅助函数的规则参数 $P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))$，$\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$C\\subseteq T^2$，$s,u\\in T$；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 $R,R'$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"0ec3908763541719","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPBetween}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]，项对同时改名谓词 $\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 与 $\\to_P^*$ 分别见 [[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]。以下辅助函数的规则参数 $P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))$，$\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$C\\subseteq T^2$，$s,u\\in T$；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 $R,R'$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:|Y|<\\aleph_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)","display":false},{"tex":"E,R,E',R'\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPBetween}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variant}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_P^*","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"s,u\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"R,R'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,>}:=\n\\{(E,R)\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)^2:\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,>)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KBState}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E,R)\\iff(E,R)\\in\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,>}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho)&:=\n\\bigcup_{\\eta\\in P\\cup\\{\\rho\\}}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho,\\eta)\\cup\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\eta,\\rho)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CPBasisNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho,C)&\\iff\nC\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CPNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,\\rho)\\;\n\\exists(u,v)\\in C\\;\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(u,v),(s,t)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(s,u)&\\iff\ns\\to_P^*u\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_P,u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KBStep}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E,R,E',R')\\iff{}&\n\\exists(A,P),(B,Q)\\in\\mathcal K^{\\mathrm{KB}}_{\\Sigma,V,>}\\;\\bigl[\n(E,R)=(A,P)\\land(E',R')=(B,Q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\exists(s,t)\\in A\\;\\exists u,v\\in T\\;[\n\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(s,u)\\land\\mathrm{NRed}_{\\Sigma,V,P}(t,v)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\bigl((u=v\\land B=A\\setminus\\{(s,t)\\}\\land Q=P)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists(l,r)\\in\\{(u,v),(v,u)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\n\\exists C\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\;[\nl>r\\land Q=P\\cup\\{(l,r)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{CPBasisNew}_{\\Sigma,V}(P,(l,r),C)\n\\land B=(A\\cup C)\\setminus\\{(s,t)\\}]\\bigr)]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4223,"backlinks":[{"id":"21ce7cb11eb92c41","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,>$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。输入 $E_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$，候选输出 $R\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$[0,n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le n\\}$，$[0,n)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}$。$D$ 为以0起始的有限序列，元素属于 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$，不预设长度或端点。$A_i,B_i$ 分别表示下文有界序列变量 $\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B$ 在 $i$ 处的值。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion.md]]"},{"id":"2735feec3db7f175","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；输入等式集 $E_0\\subseteq T^2$ 有限。假设 $\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,R)$，采用 [[56-df-completion-run]] 的完整有限成功条件及 [[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]] 的 Table 7.7 转移。$\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}$ 将有序规则对视为等式对后取等式闭包。"}],"outgoing":["59b9207cce58252c","ea6d0d000271b1cf","4176ebfcf797c869","8d38c305aa30cc4d","e295b2b3159f2b40","0ec3908763541719"]}